    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkitanapat naaipirta olasar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, “Tiaki iltung'ana le Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti nipuonunu akenya ina kop nipuopuo aamany, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ina naisho nanu intae, ninchosho Olaitoriani nkishorot naaing'uaa eluata oo nkishu, aashu enoo ntare, olasar le nkima aashu olasar opejori, aashu olasar ake duo, pee intabayaya ilo mumai aashu olasar lo lpela, aashu too lasarri linyi ootegeluaki pee intobirakiki esong'ouna narropil Olaitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore naa ilo oyau nkishorot enyena neisho sii Olaitoriani olasar le ntapa le matua e tomon e ntapa napuyiapui eipurjaki te rubata e ong'uan e ilata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o enaisho te nkaraki olasar ooki, ore erubata e ong'uan nintobir te nebo olasar opejori, aashu te nkaraki olasar, to lkuo ake le ker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aashu ore to lmeregesh nintobir to lasar le ntapa intemat are e matua e tomon e efa e ntapa napuyiapui naipurja too mboreitin uni e ilata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore to lasar ooki nintayu mboreitin uni e naisho pee eaku olng'usil orropil to Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ti nintobir oloing'oni pee eaku olasar opejori, aashu olasar, pee intabaya olmumai, aashu olasar le seriani to Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitayu ake oltung'ani te nebo ilo oing'oni olasar le ntapa loo mboreitin uni e matua e tomon e efa entapa napuyiapui, naipurjaki te ilata naitorit empirbil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninchooyo to lasar ooki empirbil naitorit e naisho oo sabibu pee eaku olasar le nkima, olng'usil orropil to Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neijia epuoi aaiko te pooki oing'oni aashu to lmeregesh, aashu te pooki sitima le ker aashu to le kine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore te risioroto e ina siana nintobiriri, naa neijia enkuna te pooki ng'ae te risioroto e siana enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo pooki inot linyi nchoo eas kuna baa tena oitoi, aaishooyo olasar le nkima, esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa te neewuo oltung'ani leiking'a amanyisho te nebo intae, aashu te netii likae tung'ani atua intae too ishoritin inyi, neyieu ninye neishoru olasar opejori, esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani, nchoo ninye eas anaa eniasiasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore te umata naa keaku enkitanapata nabo ake, te intae o to lomoni otii te nebo intae, enkitanapata nabikoo ti atua iishoritin inyi pooki, ore anaa enitiuu naa neijia etiu ilo omoni te dukuya o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 24.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keaku enkitanapata nabo o enkikoo nabo te iyie o te ilo omoni omanyisho te nebo intae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiaki iltung'ana le Israel, te nipuonunu atua ina kop nayau nanu intae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore ake pee inosinoso endaa e ina kop, nintarasakiki Olaitoriani enkishoroto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina tapa inyi e nkiterata ninchooyoyo emukate naaku olasar; ore anaa olasar oing'uaa osoit oituutishoreki, ninchooyoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo asar linyi le ntapa enkiterata enchorie Olaitoriani olasar tiatua iishoritin inyi pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kake ti ntarruoo nimimbung'ubung'u kuna kitanapat naairoro Olaitoriani aimunye Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebaiki ina olong apa naishorua Olaitoriani nkitanapat neito dukuya ti atua iishoritin inyi pooki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake te neitadiaki te nkaraki meyiolo eumata neitayu naa ina umata pooki oloti oing'oni oaku olasar opejori, esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani, te nebo olasar lenye le ntapa o lasar lenye ooki te risioroto e nkitanapata, o sitima obo le kine oaku olasar le ng'oki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitobir olapolosani olning'o lo sotua te nkaraki ina umata pooki oo ltung'ana le Israel, naa kepalakini ninye, amu enkitapong'oto apake, neyautua ninche olasar lenye, ilo asar le nkima oishori Olaitoriani, neyau ilo asar lenye le ng'oki dukuya Olaitoriani, te nkaraki ina kitarruoroto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina umata pooki oo ltung'ana le Israel naa kepalakini o ilo omoni otii te nebo ninche, amu etijing'a apa ilo orere pooki ina kitarruoroto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
